      <div type="clause" n="17">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Rect">Rect</ref> 17</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Be berebrytte . Berebryttan gebyreð corn gebrot on hær|feste æt bernes dure . gif him his ealdor|man ann 7 he hit mid getrywdan geearnoð .</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Concerning the barley-keeper To the barley-keeper is due the corn dropped at the barn’s door at harvest, if his overseer grants [it] to him, and he has earned it with diligence.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[17] Be berebrytte. Berebryttan gebyreð corngebrot on hærfeste æt bernes dure, gif him his ealdorman ann, 7 he hit mid getryw[ð]an geearnoð.</ab>
